        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Van Andel Institute, Van Andel Research Institute, Van Andel Education Institute, Amway Corporation\n- People: Jay Van Andel, Betty Van Andel, Richard DeVos, Jeffrey Trent\n- Roles: Founder, Co-founder, Vice President, Research Director\n\nFacts:\n- Jay Van Andel was born on June 3, 1924, and died on December 7, 2004.\n- Jay Van Andel was an American businessman best known as the co-founder of the Amway Corporation with Richard DeVos.\n- Van Andel Institute was founded by Jay Van Andel and Betty Van Andel in 1996.\n- Van Andel Institute is composed of two institutes: Van Andel Research Institute and Van Andel Education Institute.\n- Jeffrey Trent has served as Vice President and Research Director of the Van Andel Institute since 2009.",
